    "title": "Novelink",
    "description": "Novelink\r\n\r\nNovelink - a link from the novels to your heart, a bridge from the real world to your fantasy dreams.\r\n\r\nIn order to meet the needs of our lovely users and achieve a cost-effective reading of all books, we hereby launched this subscription app.\r\n\r\nBy subscribing to our Prime Membership, you will get the following Prime Exclusive Privileges:\r\n\r\n1. You can read all books freely. Novelink, covering novels of a rich variety of genres like Romance, Werewolf, Fantasy, CEO, Mafia, Youth, LGBTQ+, and so on, provides you with a perfect reading experience with its rich content and fluency reading without the interfere of unlocking chapters. \r\n\r\n2. You could easily find the 10000+ top and potential novels. We have customized explicit display and intelligence recommendations to help you find your loved book, such as top romance, trending werewolf, fantasy world... We lowered the price of subscriptions but didn't reduce the number of high-quality novels.\r\n\r\n3. 400+ weekly new hit stories are available. We will keep updating weekly the new arrival books and the latest chapters without letting you pace and wait a long time in the present books or plots. \r\n\r\nWe also offer exclusive benefits for new users and a free trial for every reader to have a deep dive into our app. Furthermore, you can cancel or change your subscription anytime during the subscription period.\r\n\r\nEverything you need has been prepared well. Now, it's time to download our app and give your coming reading journey a try!",
